  "description": "The meme format, juxtaposing 'how they see' (official/institutional perspective) with 'how i see' (personal/critical perspective), expresses a mocking or dismissive attitude toward the speaker or the formal setting. The visual of the man speaking at a podium with flags, combined with the text, implies a subjective, possibly negative interpretation, which is a form of mockery.",
